---
// Front 120 — bpp islands · examples/src/app/page.bpp
//
// Demonstrates: steps 1–3 in a `.bpp` page — the five client annotations
// (decision 278). The page is server-rendered markup; a `Hydrate` annotation on
// a component's tag is what sends that component's code to the browser, and
// says when. The annotations come from jhonstart's prelude: no import.
//
//   Astro                                   here
//   <InteractiveButton client:load />       <InteractiveButton #[clientLoad] />
//   <HeavyChart client:idle />              <HeavyChart #[clientIdle] />
//   <InteractiveCounter client:visible />   <InteractiveCounter #[clientVisible] />
//   <MobileNav client:media="(…)" />        <MobileNav #[clientMedia("(…)")] />
//   <InteractiveModal client:only="svelte" /> <InteractiveModal #[clientOnly] />
//
// THE ISLANDS ARE `.bp` MODULES. `#[client]` is a decorator and sits on a
// function (a tag annotation sits on a tag); the unfold of a `.bpp` file (front 116) writes its function header
// itself, and a decorator reaches it only from the header's last line or the
// file's name (decision 221). It is the split Astro has:
// an `.astro` page places the island, and the island is a component of another
// kind. `LikeButton`, `Carousel` and `MobileNav` are the three `#[client]`
// functions of `hydration-directives-example.bp`.
//
// The `.bp` form of this page, with its tests: `Home` in
// `hydration-directives-example.bp` at the root of `examples/`.
//
// Upstream: astro-docs/12-framework-components.md (Diretivas de hidratação)
//           astro-docs/02-islands-architecture.md (Client Islands)
//           https://docs.astro.build/en/reference/directives-reference/#client-directives

import {h1, p} from "jhonstart";
import {components.LikeButton};
import {components.Carousel};
import {components.MobileNav};

// the post this home page features
val slug = "hello";
---
<h1>Post</h1>

<!-- interactive as soon as the page loads -->
<LikeButton #[clientLoad] postSlug={slug} likes={3} />

<!-- started when the browser is idle; after 500 ms where it never is -->
<LikeButton #[clientIdle(500)] postSlug={slug} likes={0} />

<!-- its code is not requested until it is about to scroll into view -->
<Carousel #[clientVisible("200px")] images={12} />

<!-- only on a narrow screen -->
<MobileNav #[clientMedia("(max-width: 50em)")] open={false} />

<!-- never rendered on the server: the fallback is, and the browser renders the rest -->
<Carousel #[clientOnly] images={3}>
  <p slot="fallback">Loading the gallery…</p>
</Carousel>

<!-- no annotation: server-rendered markup, no JavaScript sent for it -->
<LikeButton postSlug={slug} likes={9} />
